      "lineNbr": 497,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T05:26:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Genuine discussion:\n\nWho will call theses API ?\n\nFrom the bug it looks like this CL is to\n\u003e create a HID connection when LEA toggle is off,  \nand created HoGP connection when LEA toggle is on\n\nIf the toggle can be read from Bluetooth, I do not see why we need an API for.\n\nI am probably missing a key step here...\nThe only thing I see is that if we want to add extra possibility to above statement like:\n\n* create a HID connection \n   * when LEA toggle is `off` and transport if `BR_EDR`\n   * when LEA toggle is `off` and transport if `AUTO`\n* Block HID connection when lea toggle is `off` and transport is `LE`\n* created HoGP connection \n   * when LEA toggle is `on` and transport if `LE`\n   * when LEA toggle is `on` and transport if `AUTO`\n* Block HID connection when lea toggle is `on` and transport is `BR_EDR`",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 497,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 497,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "bf11649081acf55b3823295b5e553287ac8d7d03",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1762065d_461180e2",
        "filename": "framework/java/android/bluetooth/BluetoothHidHost.java",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 497,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882530
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T21:48:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This API is designed to be independent from LE Audio. The decision to set the preferred transport is left to a higher layer (Settings app, companion app, etc). At present, it is expected to be used by LE Audio.\nIf this API is not called, preferred transport remains AUTO in which case the HID host should behave as it does currently, i.e. HID host native makes an educated *guess* on the transport to use.\nIf the API is called for a specific transport, connection on other transport would be blocked.",
      "parentUuid": "2f57bc11_2b21bcee",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 497,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 497,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "bf11649081acf55b3823295b5e553287ac8d7d03",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
